fontsize=11</panel_attributes><additional_attributes>65;10;10;19</additional_attributes></element><element><id>UMLNote</id><coordinates><x>30</x><y>1263</y><w>815</w><h>115</h></coordinates><panel_attributes>GameState owns exactly 4 PoliticalEvents. All three listeners reference GameState.
Notification order: PoliticalSystem -&gt; EventManager -&gt; HistoryRecorder.
Events run E1 -&gt; E2 -&gt; E3 -&gt; E4; each has one current EventState.
EventManager also uses GameRules; Controller holds the current GameState.
